title: All the Things You Are
key: Ab
tempo: 160
style: jazz

// Thirty-six bars, AABA with a last A of twelve. The first A goes round the
// cycle from F minor to C major, the second the same a fifth lower to G; the
// bridge is in G and then E, and C7#5 turns E back to the F minor of the
// last A, which goes further round, by the minor four, before it lands.
[A]
| Fm7    | Bbm7   | Eb7   | Abmaj7 |
| Dbmaj7 | Dm7 G7 | Cmaj7 | %      |

[A2]
| Cm7    | Fm7    | Bb7   | Ebmaj7 |
| Abmaj7 | Am7 D7 | Gmaj7 | %      |

[B]
| Am7  | D7 | Gmaj7 | %    |
| F#m7 | B7 | Emaj7 | C7#5 |

[A3]
| Fm7    | Bbm7 | Eb7    | Abmaj7     |
| Dbmaj7 | Dbm7 | Cm7    | Bdim7      |
| Bbm7   | Eb7  | Abmaj7 | Gm7b5 C7b9 |
